[{"id":"d2735da","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"column","align_items":"stretch"},"elements":[{"id":"45aa3a0","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"column","align_items":"center","background_background":"classic","background_color":"#F6F9FC","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"48","right":"40","bottom":"48","left":"40","isLinked":false}},"elements":[{"id":"2d34e6a","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full","width":{"size":100,"unit":"%"},"max_width":{"size":1240,"unit":"px"},"flex_direction":"column","align_items":"flex-start"},"elements":[{"id":"0fc435e","elType":"container","settings":{"width":{"size":100,"unit":"%"},"max_width":{"size":820,"unit":"px"},"flex_direction":"column","align_items":"flex-start","gap":{"unit":"px","size":16,"sizes":[],"column":"16","row":"16","isLinked":true}},"elements":[{"id":"0a550b2","elType":"widget","widgetType":"heading","settings":{"title":"How to pay with crypto","header_size":"h1"},"elements":[]},{"id":"717bb10","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>Biopentra accepts crypto payments in two ways: pay with Bitcoin directly, or pay with your card through an independent third-party provider that converts your payment to crypto. This guide explains what to expect at checkout.<\/p>"},"elements":[]}]}]}]},{"id":"04763b7","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"column","align_items":"center","background_background":"classic","background_color":"#FFFFFF","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"48","right":"40","bottom":"48","left":"40","isLinked":false}},"elements":[{"id":"f96cc8e","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full","width":{"size":100,"unit":"%"},"max_width":{"size":1240,"unit":"px"},"flex_direction":"column","align_items":"flex-start"},"elements":[{"id":"834aed1","elType":"container","settings":{"width":{"size":100,"unit":"%"},"max_width":{"size":820,"unit":"px"},"flex_direction":"column","align_items":"flex-start","gap":{"unit":"px","size":16,"sizes":[],"column":"16","row":"16","isLinked":true},"_element_id":"pay-with-bitcoin"},"elements":[{"id":"84efbc5","elType":"widget","widgetType":"heading","settings":{"title":"Pay with Bitcoin (BTCPay)","header_size":"h2"},"elements":[]},{"id":"ffba0e5","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<ol><li>At checkout, select the <strong>Bitcoin \/ BTCPay<\/strong> payment method (the exact label is shown at checkout).<\/li><li>Click <strong>Place order<\/strong>. You may be redirected to BTCPay or see an invoice modal, depending on store configuration.<\/li><li>Pay the invoice amount using your wallet (QR code, copy address, or wallet connect, as offered).<\/li><li>Complete payment before the invoice expires.<\/li><li>Order confirmation is sent by email. Timing depends on network confirmation. You may or may not return to the shop afterward.<\/li><\/ol>"},"elements":[]}]}]}]},{"id":"e0c4fec","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"column","align_items":"center","background_background":"classic","background_color":"#F6F9FC","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"48","right":"40","bottom":"48","left":"40","isLinked":false}},"elements":[{"id":"82e8ca7","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full","width":{"size":100,"unit":"%"},"max_width":{"size":1240,"unit":"px"},"flex_direction":"column","align_items":"flex-start"},"elements":[{"id":"dac874e","elType":"container","settings":{"width":{"size":100,"unit":"%"},"max_width":{"size":820,"unit":"px"},"flex_direction":"column","align_items":"flex-start","gap":{"unit":"px","size":16,"sizes":[],"column":"16","row":"16","isLinked":true},"_element_id":"pay-with-card"},"elements":[{"id":"a08260e","elType":"widget","widgetType":"heading","settings":{"title":"Pay with card (card-to-crypto overview)","header_size":"h2"},"elements":[]},{"id":"210bb7b","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>When you select the Blockchain.com payment method \u2014 or any other method labelled <strong>\u201cCard to\u2026\u201d<\/strong> \u2014 you are redirected to a third-party payment provider. The process is usually similar: register (first time) or log in (returning). First-time users <strong>often<\/strong> need identity verification (KYC). Follow the provider\u2019s instructions.<\/p><p><strong>Important:<\/strong> Do not change the cryptocurrency or wallet\/blockchain address shown during checkout \u2014 these are set by the payment flow.<\/p><ol><li>At checkout, select a <strong>card-to-crypto<\/strong> payment method (the provider name is shown at checkout).<\/li><li>Click <strong>Place order<\/strong> \u2014 you are redirected to that provider\u2019s hosted checkout (not Biopentra).<\/li><li>The provider may request identity verification, depending on their requirements and your history with them.<\/li><li>Pay using a payment method accepted by that provider. Debit cards are often more reliable than credit cards, but acceptance varies.<\/li><li>After the provider completes payment, Biopentra receives confirmation asynchronously. You should receive an order confirmation email. You may or may not be redirected back to the shop.<\/li><\/ol>"},"elements":[]}]}]}]},{"id":"6852a7e","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"column","align_items":"center","background_background":"classic","background_color":"#FFFFFF","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"48","right":"40","bottom":"48","left":"40","isLinked":false}},"elements":[{"id":"4a2fe64","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full","width":{"size":100,"unit":"%"},"max_width":{"size":1240,"unit":"px"},"flex_direction":"column","align_items":"flex-start"},"elements":[{"id":"2689a0b","elType":"container","settings":{"width":{"size":100,"unit":"%"},"max_width":{"size":820,"unit":"px"},"flex_direction":"column","align_items":"flex-start","gap":{"unit":"px","size":16,"sizes":[],"column":"16","row":"16","isLinked":true},"_element_id":"pay-with-blockchain-com"},"elements":[{"id":"2f93cd8","elType":"widget","widgetType":"heading","settings":{"title":"Pay with Blockchain.com","header_size":"h2"},"elements":[]},{"id":"61f17a1","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p id=\"pay-with-blockchain-com\">Detailed walkthrough for the Blockchain.com card-to-crypto gateway. Other <strong>Card to\u2026<\/strong> providers follow a similar pattern, but screens and options may differ.<\/p>"},"elements":[]},{"id":"22db9e2","elType":"widget","widgetType":"heading","settings":{"title":"On the provider checkout","header_size":"h3"},"elements":[]},{"id":"763ab61","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"column","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"24","left":"0","isLinked":false}},"elements":[{"id":"7d58022","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p><strong>Step 1 \u2014 Amount:<\/strong> You are presented with a screen for the order amount. Accept it and press <strong>Preview buy<\/strong>.<\/p>"},"elements":[]},{"id":"dfc66d6","elType":"widget","widgetType":"image","settings":{"image":{"url":"https:\/\/dev.biopentra.eu\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/blockchain-amount-preview-buy.png","id":4606,"size":"large","alt":"Blockchain.com checkout showing order amount and Preview buy button","source":"library"}},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"2312bd4","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"column","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"24","left":"0","isLinked":false}},"elements":[{"id":"e2d33db","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p><strong>Step 2 \u2014 Email:<\/strong> Log in or supply your email address.<\/p>"},"elements":[]},{"id":"b8adbf1","elType":"widget","widgetType":"image","settings":{"image":{"url":"https:\/\/dev.biopentra.eu\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/blockchain-login-email.png","id":4607,"size":"large","alt":"Blockchain.com login or email entry screen","source":"library"}},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"78cffd2","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"column","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"24","left":"0","isLinked":false}},"elements":[{"id":"78a9e72","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p><strong>Step 3 \u2014 Verify email:<\/strong> Complete email verification as instructed.<\/p>"},"elements":[]},{"id":"a566f4c","elType":"widget","widgetType":"image","settings":{"image":{"url":"https:\/\/dev.biopentra.eu\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/blockchain-verify-email.png","id":4608,"size":"large","alt":"Email verification step on Blockchain.com","source":"library"}},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"72c5e98","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"column","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"24","left":"0","isLinked":false}},"elements":[{"id":"b3edcd1","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p><strong>Step 4 \u2014 KYC form:<\/strong> Fill out identity verification if required. This information is sent to the payment provider only \u2014 not to Biopentra.<\/p>"},"elements":[]},{"id":"f8ea573","elType":"widget","widgetType":"image","settings":{"image":{"url":"https:\/\/dev.biopentra.eu\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/blockchain-kyc-form.png","id":4609,"size":"large","alt":"KYC information form on payment provider","source":"library"}},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"565b271","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"column","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"24","left":"0","isLinked":false}},"elements":[{"id":"f2b7f46","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p><strong>Step 5 \u2014 Government ID:<\/strong> If instructed to complete KYC, you may need a government-issued ID (such as a passport).<\/p>"},"elements":[]},{"id":"41e2f45","elType":"widget","widgetType":"image","settings":{"image":{"url":"https:\/\/dev.biopentra.eu\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/blockchain-kyc-id.png","id":4610,"size":"large","alt":"Government ID upload for KYC verification","source":"library"}},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"cf7200f","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"column","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"24","left":"0","isLinked":false}},"elements":[{"id":"41a4777","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p><strong>Step 6 \u2014 Payment method:<\/strong> Select a payment option accepted by the provider. The example below shows <strong>Google Pay<\/strong> \u2014 <em>example only; available payment methods depend on the provider and your region.<\/em><\/p>"},"elements":[]},{"id":"3b1a814","elType":"widget","widgetType":"image","settings":{"image":{"url":"https:\/\/dev.biopentra.eu\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/blockchain-payment-google-pay.png","id":4611,"size":"large","alt":"Payment method selection example using Google Pay on Blockchain.com","source":"library"}},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"9e7b859","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"column","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"24","left":"0","isLinked":false}},"elements":[{"id":"6d839d7","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p><strong>Step 7 \u2014 Complete purchase:<\/strong> Review and complete the purchase. The wallet address and cryptocurrency type are pre-set for this order \u2014 do not modify them.<\/p>"},"elements":[]},{"id":"17e3de5","elType":"widget","widgetType":"image","settings":{"image":{"url":"https:\/\/dev.biopentra.eu\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/blockchain-complete-purchase.png","id":4612,"size":"large","alt":"Final purchase confirmation with pre-set crypto address on Blockchain.com","source":"library"}},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"13659fe","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p><strong>Step 8 \u2014 Payment completed:<\/strong> Once payment is completed on the provider site, you can ignore any subsequent pages there. The crypto transfer may take several minutes; timing varies.<\/p><p><strong>Step 9 \u2014 After payment:<\/strong> Typically you are <strong>not<\/strong> returned to the shop automatically. If you return manually, your order may temporarily appear unpaid and your cart may still look populated while settlement completes \u2014 this can be normal.<\/p>"},"elements":[]},{"id":"6b03b73","elType":"widget","widgetType":"heading","settings":{"title":"What you\u2019ll see back in the store","header_size":"h3"},"elements":[]},{"id":"b1e3094","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"column","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"24","left":"0","isLinked":false}},"elements":[{"id":"4701920","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>While the payment is being registered, your order may show as awaiting payment. Wait rather than placing a duplicate order.<\/p>"},"elements":[]},{"id":"e1d4699","elType":"widget","widgetType":"image","settings":{"image":{"url":"https:\/\/dev.biopentra.eu\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/biopentra-order-pending-payment.png","id":4613,"size":"large","alt":"Biopentra order showing pending payment while settlement completes","source":"library"}},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"3724b7f","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"column","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"24","left":"0","isLinked":false}},"elements":[{"id":"7da093e","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>After a few minutes, the status should change to <strong>Processing<\/strong> once payment is confirmed.<\/p>"},"elements":[]},{"id":"8031a0d","elType":"widget","widgetType":"image","settings":{"image":{"url":"https:\/\/dev.biopentra.eu\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/biopentra-order-processing.png","id":4614,"size":"large","alt":"Biopentra order status changed to Processing","source":"library"}},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"4328e0a","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"column","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"24","left":"0","isLinked":false}},"elements":[{"id":"7c0dbda","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>When payment is registered, you will receive a confirmation email. You will receive a separate email when your order is shipped.<\/p>"},"elements":[]},{"id":"dbe7c5c","elType":"widget","widgetType":"image","settings":{"image":{"url":"https:\/\/dev.biopentra.eu\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/biopentra-order-confirmation-email.png","id":4615,"size":"large","alt":"Order confirmation email from Biopentra","source":"library"}},"elements":[]}]}]}]}]},{"id":"db30d8d","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"column","align_items":"center","background_background":"classic","background_color":"#F6F9FC","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"48","right":"40","bottom":"48","left":"40","isLinked":false}},"elements":[{"id":"1892e74","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full","width":{"size":100,"unit":"%"},"max_width":{"size":1240,"unit":"px"},"flex_direction":"column","align_items":"flex-start"},"elements":[{"id":"8509c60","elType":"container","settings":{"width":{"size":100,"unit":"%"},"max_width":{"size":820,"unit":"px"},"flex_direction":"column","align_items":"flex-start","gap":{"unit":"px","size":16,"sizes":[],"column":"16","row":"16","isLinked":true}},"elements":[{"id":"c68d246","elType":"widget","widgetType":"heading","settings":{"title":"Other card-to-crypto providers","header_size":"h2"},"elements":[]},{"id":"b0597ea","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p><strong>Revolut<\/strong> and <strong>Bitnovo<\/strong> use the same general flow described above. Screens, verification steps, accepted cards, and redirect behaviour <strong>may differ<\/strong> from Blockchain.com. Select the provider shown at checkout and follow its instructions.<\/p>"},"elements":[]}]}]}]},{"id":"80864f6","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"column","align_items":"center","background_background":"classic","background_color":"#FFFFFF","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"48","right":"40","bottom":"48","left":"40","isLinked":false}},"elements":[{"id":"2c5af43","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full","width":{"size":100,"unit":"%"},"max_width":{"size":1240,"unit":"px"},"flex_direction":"column","align_items":"flex-start"},"elements":[{"id":"a787ace","elType":"container","settings":{"width":{"size":100,"unit":"%"},"max_width":{"size":820,"unit":"px"},"flex_direction":"column","align_items":"flex-start","gap":{"unit":"px","size":16,"sizes":[],"column":"16","row":"16","isLinked":true}},"elements":[{"id":"afa6f22","elType":"widget","widgetType":"heading","settings":{"title":"Fees","header_size":"h2"},"elements":[]},{"id":"73425b6","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>Payment fees, if any, are shown on the payment method label and in your order total at checkout.<\/p><table><thead><tr><th><\/th><th>Bitcoin (BTCPay)<\/th><th>Card-to-crypto<\/th><\/tr><\/thead><tbody><tr><td>Fee<\/td><td>Shown at checkout<\/td><td>Shown at checkout<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table>"},"elements":[]}]}]}]},{"id":"68a4ed2","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"column","align_items":"center","background_background":"classic","background_color":"#F6F9FC","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"48","right":"40","bottom":"48","left":"40","isLinked":false}},"elements":[{"id":"60b92cb","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full","width":{"size":100,"unit":"%"},"max_width":{"size":1240,"unit":"px"},"flex_direction":"column","align_items":"flex-start"},"elements":[{"id":"d1e62e7","elType":"container","settings":{"width":{"size":100,"unit":"%"},"max_width":{"size":820,"unit":"px"},"flex_direction":"column","align_items":"flex-start","gap":{"unit":"px","size":16,"sizes":[],"column":"16","row":"16","isLinked":true}},"elements":[{"id":"08826c4","elType":"widget","widgetType":"heading","settings":{"title":"Frequently asked questions","header_size":"h2"},"elements":[]},{"id":"2d9d50b","elType":"widget","widgetType":"toggle","settings":{"tabs":[{"tab_title":"Why was I sent to another website to pay?","tab_content":"Card-to-crypto payments are completed on the provider\u2019s secure checkout. Biopentra does not process card details directly."},{"tab_title":"Does Biopentra see my card, ID, or KYC details?","tab_content":"No. Identity verification and card payment are handled entirely by the third-party provider."},{"tab_title":"Why does my order still look unpaid after I paid?","tab_content":"Settlement can take several minutes. Your order should update once the provider confirms payment to Biopentra."},{"tab_title":"Why wasn\u2019t I returned to the shop?","tab_content":"Many provider checkouts do not redirect back to the store. Wait for your confirmation email instead of placing a duplicate order."},{"tab_title":"How long until my order is confirmed?","tab_content":"Often within a few minutes, but timing varies depending on the provider and payment method."},{"tab_title":"Which payment method should I choose?","tab_content":"Bitcoin (BTCPay) suits customers with a crypto wallet. Card-to-crypto suits customers who prefer paying by card."},{"tab_title":"What if payment fails or I close the browser?","tab_content":"Return to checkout and try again, or contact support with your order number if you were charged but the order did not update."}]},"elements":[]}]}]}]},{"id":"1879034","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"column","align_items":"center","background_background":"classic","background_color":"#FFFFFF","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"48","right":"40","bottom":"48","left":"40","isLinked":false}},"elements":[{"id":"4751f61","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full","width":{"size":100,"unit":"%"},"max_width":{"size":1240,"unit":"px"},"flex_direction":"column","align_items":"flex-start"},"elements":[{"id":"030874b","elType":"container","settings":{"width":{"size":100,"unit":"%"},"max_width":{"size":820,"unit":"px"},"flex_direction":"column","align_items":"flex-start","gap":{"unit":"px","size":16,"sizes":[],"column":"16","row":"16","isLinked":true}},"elements":[{"id":"c6fe284","elType":"widget","widgetType":"button","settings":{"text":"Proceed to checkout","link":{"url":"https:\/\/dev.biopentra.eu\/checkout\/","is_external":"","nofollow":""},"align":"left"},"elements":[]}]}]}]}]}]
